{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04985","headline":"仪坤庙乐章 · 郑善玉","name":"仪坤庙乐章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"酌郁既灌，取萧方爇。\n笾豆静器，簠簋芬飶。\n鱼腊荐美，牲牷表絜。\n是戢是将，载迎载列。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑善玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04985.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04985","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}